{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God of Y is an epic RPG that puts players in the role of a chosen god, searching for the true power of the \u201cGod of Y\u201d in a world where chaos and order are intertwined. The game combines open-world exploration, a dynamic quest system, and in-depth combat mechanics, allowing players to freely choose their growth paths, unlock divine skill trees, and utilize powerful divine magic in battle against their fated enemies. The game utilizes a turn-based combat system combined with tactical decision-making to make every battle challenging. The player's choices will influence the world and determine whether to seal or inherit the power of the \u201cGod of Y\u201d.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517110?t=1748693986","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517110?t=1748693986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517110/ce3b00c49e9f2215017ad243524f9aa779049ede/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748693986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517110/ce3b00c49e9f2215017ad243524f9aa779049ede/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748693986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God of Y is an epic RPG that puts players in the role of a chosen god, searching for the true power of the \u201cGod of Y\u201d in a world where chaos and order are intertwined. The game combines open-world exploration, a dynamic quest system, and in-depth combat mechanics, allowing players to freely choose their growth paths, unlock divine skill trees, and utilize powerful divine magic in battle against their fated enemies. The game utilizes a turn-based combat system combined with tactical decision-making to make every battle chal